                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5e3404e6-28eb-4cb2-b991-51a6044c2da2",
                        "entry_id": "17a5eddf-64d8-38b3-b0a5-eeacfa9e4242",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most lifeful"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5f3c4213-f62a-3a7b-b66a-a3302fd0e814",
                        "entry_id": "17a5eddf-64d8-38b3-b0a5-eeacfa9e4242",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a lifeful manner; full of life."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e040fb7-3138-41ff-8eb1-02da8368ef29",
                                "sense_id": "5f3c4213-f62a-3a7b-b66a-a3302fd0e814",
                                "text": "A colour grew / Upon his cheek, while thus he lifeful spake."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "64f48a5e-3020-441e-ba18-bb2c4846d08c",
                                "sense_id": "5f3c4213-f62a-3a7b-b66a-a3302fd0e814",
                                "text": "Although the auburn and the black hackles are killing enough in the Highland glens and moorlands, and are good general flies, in some favourite places, where the warmer, richer streams flow lifeful from the glorious lake, above the wooded glen that opens on the fertile valley, the ' Professor,' with all his wily vagaries, is the only tempter that can allure, the only charmer that can charm."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b5d9fe7-f380-480b-8464-18efa645bfd7",
                                "sense_id": "5f3c4213-f62a-3a7b-b66a-a3302fd0e814",
                                "text": "Million blossoms burst forth lifeful in their bright colours and perfumes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "c45a63e0-5772-3d25-b8af-46f195e79713",
                "word": "lifeful",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ea2607cc-2186-4e25-b806-cd06f359c5ef",
                        "entry_id": "c45a63e0-5772-3d25-b8af-46f195e79713",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lifefuls"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4927e3d-0e10-32c6-a1a9-edc8b917b3b4",
                        "entry_id": "c45a63e0-5772-3d25-b8af-46f195e79713",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A quantity that fills a lifetime."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf25c4f5-b962-4ca3-bfcd-13451a1fd973",
                                "sense_id": "c4927e3d-0e10-32c6-a1a9-edc8b917b3b4",
                                "text": "There seems to be an enormous waste of human goodness, while we have at the same time so little of it that we cannot afford, if we only knew our true interests, to lose a single lifeful."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8f44154-0e9c-4b10-bd5b-18c6cae78915",
                                "sense_id": "c4927e3d-0e10-32c6-a1a9-edc8b917b3b4",
                                "text": "I have thus rapidly outlined what I think we may fairly describe as about two lifefuls of work, but there still remains a third."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b087158-c439-4f59-8f04-77cbe72fc694",
                                "sense_id": "c4927e3d-0e10-32c6-a1a9-edc8b917b3b4",
                                "text": "Controversial issues are nothing new to this woman who has jammed two or three lives-ful of events in her 82 years."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8f78d25-0795-4e0e-8c7c-912f64da98fc",
                                "sense_id": "c4927e3d-0e10-32c6-a1a9-edc8b917b3b4",
                                "text": "She gave so much to so many and now her life is gone -- and what did she ever get out of it?--Nothing--just nothing. A lifeful of nothing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7c2c06c-c329-44f4-bef2-7e40f8467c7f",
                                "sense_id": "c4927e3d-0e10-32c6-a1a9-edc8b917b3b4",
                                "text": "These two specific guys don't deserve the rage a lifeful of such remarks, “ignored,” have engendered."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd304065-a28a-4e8e-8389-5ca2abb99c5d",
                                "sense_id": "c4927e3d-0e10-32c6-a1a9-edc8b917b3b4",
                                "text": "The poor fellow had a lifeful of losses."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
